{
    "name": "Two Worlds",
    "description": "Neither world will hold you forever. You get ten minutes in whichever one you stand in. A single bar shows your time left, blue waves in the water and green grass on land, and the other world's time refills twenty times faster while you are away. When the bar empties, that world starts wearing you down, slowly but steadily, until you see the light.",
